# vnavmesh Integration

## Purpose
Integration patterns for vnavmesh plugin navigation functionality in SND macros.

## Scope
This rule covers vnavmesh movement patterns, pathfinding, navigation error handling, and complete API integration.

## Complete vnavmesh API Reference

### Status and Management Functions
```lua
-- Check if vnavmesh is ready
IPC.vnavmesh.IsReady()

-- Get build progress (0.0 to 1.0)
