## State Machine Integration

### Movement State Pattern
```lua
-- Add movement state to your state machine
CharacterState = {
    ready = Ready,
    moving = Moving,
    -- ... other states
}

function Moving()
    if MoveToPositionWithTimeout(targetX, targetY, targetZ, 30) then
        yield("/echo [Script] Movement completed")
